  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan returns to his youth by the Spring Autumn Cicada after a first life of about five hundred years. He means to remain a demon if reborn.",
      "chapters": [
        1
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He carries into this life a heart set on immortality. His twin brother is Gu Yue Fang Zheng.",
      "chapters": [
        2
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Gu Yue clan migrated from the central lands to the South Border. Talent grades from A to D by how far a fifteen-year-old walks into the moon orchid sea.",
      "chapters": [
        4
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_aptitude"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pressure on that walk comes from a spirit spring deep in the flower sea.",
      "chapters": [
        5
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan opens as a rank one Gu Master with C grade talent; Fang Zheng is A grade, and the clan head names himself Gu Yue Bo.",
      "chapters": [
        6
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_c_grade",
        "char_gu_yue_bo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A week later the academy teaches the nine Gu Master ranks, retells the Flower Wine Monk’s fight with the fourth clan head, and Fang Yuan begins hunting a Liquor worm he remembers from that inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        7
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ranks_and_realms",
        "char_flower_wine_monk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s memory, a heartbroken clan Gu Master’s wine draws a Liquor worm, and following it into a hole he finds the Flower Wine Monk’s bones and inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        7
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liquor-worm-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan follows a Liquor worm into a cliff chamber and finds the Flower Wine Monk’s bones.",
      "chapters": [
        14
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liquor-worm-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In that chamber a Photo-audio Gu projects a looping motion picture with sound on the stone wall: the Flower Wine Monk’s fight with the fourth generation clan head, recorded once and left to feed on light and sound while it repeats.",
      "chapters": [
        16
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liquor-worm-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_photo_audio_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He finishes refining the Liquor worm by pressing it with the Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura, then refines a Moonlight Gu the same way and reports to the academy as the first finisher under his own name.",
      "chapters": [
        20
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liquor-worm-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_moonlight_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jia Fu, rank four leader of the Jia merchant caravan, reaches Gu Yue Village on a Treasure Brass Toad.",
      "chapters": [
        39
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merchant-caravan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jia_fu",
        "gu_treasure_brass_toad"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jia Jin Sheng names himself when he barges into the rock gambling den and tries to buy Fang Yuan’s unfinished mudball.",
      "chapters": [
        42
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merchant-caravan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jia_jin_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before that night Fang Yuan still weighs selling the image wall, noting that the Flower Wine Monk slapped the Photo-audio Gu onto the wall so the recording would loop and show the truth.",
      "chapters": [
        45
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "image-wall-night",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the image wall cave, after Jia Jin Sheng presses him about what he gained from the Flower Wine Monk, Fang Yuan kills him with moonblades.",
      "chapters": [
        46
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "image-wall-night",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later Jia Fu interrogates him with the rank four Bamboo Gentleman; under the Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura the Gu fails to mark his answers as lies. Jia Fu leaves Gu Yue Village planning to hire Tie Xue Leng.",
      "chapters": [
        57
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merchant-investigation-close",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_bamboo_gentleman_gu",
        "char_tie_xue_leng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same hire is also called Tie Leng Xue, and Fang Yuan treats the murder trouble as settled.",
      "chapters": [
        59
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merchant-investigation-close",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Mao Mountain continues from chapter 60.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "merchant-investigation-close",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_qing_mao_mountain"
      ]
    }
  ],
